; root cluster for all biology domain nodes.
; biology is grounded in chemistry: all life processes are chemical reactions.
; inherits chemistry-varga which in turn reaches physics and math.
; domain identity
; sangati roots

(kosha biology-varga
  (sthita domain-biology)
  (vishesa chemistry-varga)
  (swarupa subanta)
  (yukta spanda sva-dharana kramanusara avastha))
